# ISOs never enter git (2.4+ GiB each) — they ship ONLY from the .onion
# service on the home server (published with website/onion-sync.sh). They are
# staged here locally just long enough to rsync up. Never on Cloudflare Pages
# (25 MiB cap), never in a clearnet object store.
# Only the .sha256 sidecars are versioned with the site.
*.iso
